# NOTE: db.sqlite3 and website/media/ are intentionally NOT ignored.
# The Render deploy serves the committed DB snapshot
# (website/db.sqlite3) and the committed bird photos
# (website/media/birds/). Do not ignore them until the site moves to
# Postgres + object storage for media -- ignoring them now would
# deploy an empty site.

